{
 "info": {
  "_postman_id": "or-record-type-audit-2026-11-25",
  "name": "OpenRegister Record Type Audit",
  "description": "Schema and register changes on the audit trail, asserted over HTTP (change capability-rows-verified-c, task 2.3).\n\nWHAT IT ASSERTS: creating, changing and deleting a register and a schema each leave one audit row with the action (`register.created|updated|deleted`, `schema.created|updated|deleted`), the item's uuid and the acting administrator; a change row carries what changed.\n\nWHAT IT DOES NOT ASSERT: the before and after values of a change. The audit list masks `changed` for every reader; RecordTypeAuditListenerTest covers the values.\n\nHermetic: it creates its register and schema and removes both.",
  "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
 },
